description	"RAB-24 Imperial Remnant Heavy War Droid

A advanced Imperial Remnant War Droid with high suppression and tracking abilities.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Droid Melee
-- Cripples On Hit
-- 60 Flat Knockback On Slap
- DLT-19 Targeting Cannon (1)
-- DC Carbine 
-- 50% More RoF
-- 60% Less Damage
-- 65% Less Force Drain
-- 15% Faster Velocity
-- Slow Movement
-- Tracks/Cripples On Hit
-- Mag Reload
- Smoke Grenades (4)
-- 0 Damage
-- Large Radius, Blinds/Cripples/Tracks
-- 60% Faster RoF
- Disorder Grenades (3)
-- Frag Grenade
-- 50% Less Damage
-- Large Radius, Cripples/Poisons/Sonic Shocks
-- 60% Faster RoF

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armor 
- Tank Like Attributes
- 40% Less Knockback Taken
- Personal Shield 
- Cortosis (1)
- Close Combat Training (2)
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Battery Recharge (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Healing (3)
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Strength (1)

^8Abilities:
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS1]"